{"id":"u-9539a44b-3d2c-41e5-a517-a1ab691cb84b","src":"community","title":"5/3/1 for grapplers","author":"GenkiSudo","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/JSf_YQ-5-3-1-for-grapplers","desc":"5/3/1 for grapplers/BJJ/MMA. 2x per week to focus on training but still getting stronger. All last sets should be an AMRAP for main movements. Use 85-90% of 1rm as a training max. Use training max for percentages within the program. Assistance work can be whatever, I include a push pull single leg/core but change how you see fit, 50-100 reps break up how you choose. I would recommend super setting a lot of the assistance for cardio/ time management. Always prioritise skill acquisition over weight training, pull back on assistance if recovery becomes an issue.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Bodyweight Fitness","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":6,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-10T15:08:29.508Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":50}]},{"n":"Push Up","sets":[{"r":50}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":100}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":50}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":50}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":100}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":50}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":50}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":70},{"r":3,"pct":80},{"r":3,"pct":90}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":70},{"r":3,"pct":80},{"r":3,"pct":90}]},{"n":"Blank Bodyweight Row","sets":[{"r":100